            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Mining is done 70% open pit and 30% underground, followed by a beneficiation of the ore trough classification. Overburden and tailings are non-sulphidic , they are disposed near the mining site.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes a mining and a beneficiation step with the mining infrastructure and disposal of overburden and tailings (see part II "Auxiliary Processes").</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
